tokio-postgres 0.7.18 (vendor/tokio-postgres)
================================================================================

A modified copy of the tokio-postgres crate, from rust-postgres
(https://github.com/rust-postgres/rust-postgres), extracted from the published
crate https://static.crates.io/crates/tokio-postgres/tokio-postgres-0.7.18.crate.
The changes add text-format query results (Transaction::bind_text and
bind_raw_text) and an optional cap on the size of a backend message
(Config::max_backend_message_size). Each change is marked "pghacker-mcp fork
edit", and vendor/tokio-postgres/FORK-README.md lists them.

